[[0,99924,0,5,0,5,"2015-05-24T08:24:14","casebash","",[],"","Ireland just voted for gay marriage. Which country do you think will be next?","","AskVoat"],[1,189801,0,1,0,1,"2015-05-24T13:22:32","DrWorm","",[],"<p>I have hope that the U.S. Supreme Court will legalize it nationwide. They typically leave the big ones wait until the last day of the term (so the last week of June), so I suspect that'll be when we know.</p>"],[1,189945,0,0,0,0,"2015-05-24T15:41:28","123_456","",[],"<p>Saudi Arabia.</p>"],[1,190294,0,0,0,0,"2015-05-24T19:33:55","chamington","",[],"<p>Probably Iceland. They are known to be a very nice country (someone left their baby stroller out on a sidewalk to get something from a store, that's how much Icelanders trust each other)</p>"],[1,191779,0,0,0,0,"2015-05-25T04:05:40","Puptaw","",[],"<p>More than likely it will be the next country with the most moral decline.</p>"]]